== 3. Robustness to extreme burden ============================= 
  Burden spans 8 to 26,500 mutations, so a handful of hypermutated 
  tumours can dominate a rank correlation while contributing little 
  to a linear one. Each test is recomputed with the top 10% of 
  burden removed. 
