== 4. The purity-composition confound ========================== 
  For purity to manufacture a negative burden-expression correlation, 
  all three must hold: 
    (a) purity NEGATIVELY correlated with expression 
    (b) purity POSITIVELY correlated with burden 
    (c) and the burden-expression association must then weaken when 
        purity is held constant 
 
    (a) purity vs RASSF9 expression                  n = 411  rho = -0.204  p = 3.01e-05 
    (a) purity vs RASSF10 expression                 n = 411  rho = +0.075  p = 0.130 
    (b) purity vs Total burden                       n = 411  rho = -0.042  p = 0.398 
    (b) purity vs UV (SBS7)                          n = 411  rho = +0.047  p = 0.337 
    (b) purity vs Non-UV burden                      n = 411  rho = -0.035  p = 0.479 
    (b) purity vs UV fraction                        n = 411  rho = -0.007  p = 0.895 

